er's £50,000 purse.\\n\\nBy ... \",\"title\":\"https://publishingperspectives.com/2022/05/geetanjali-shree-and-daisy-rockwell-win-the-international-booker-prize/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... Winner of the 2017 Man Booker International Prize.\\n\\nHerrera explores the crossings and translations people make in their minds and language as they move from one country to another, especially when there's no going back. Traversing this lonely territory is Makina, a young woman who knows only ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nypl.org/spotlight/world-literature-festival/recommended-translations\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Coetzee | Slow Man | Secker & Warburg | *John Sutherland (chair) *Lindsay Duguid *Rick Gekoski *Josephine Hart *David Sexton |\\n| 2005 The Booker Prizes |url= |access-date=2022-10-19 |website=thebookerprizes.com |language=en |archive-date=10 December 2022 |archive-url= |url-status=live }} | Longlist | Rachel Cusk | In the Fold | Faber ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d38\"},\"ref\":\"d38\",\"snippet\":\" ... Founded in 1950, the National Book Awards committee meets annually and handpicks 25 \\\"distinguished writers, translators, critics, librarians, and booksellers\\\" to form the judging committee for the National Book Awards.\\n\\n-\\n\\nThe Neustadt International Prize for Literature\\n\\nThe Neustadt International Prize for Literature, which used to be called the ... \",\"title\":\"https://theurbanwriters.com/blogs/publishing/13-most-prestigious-literary-awards-for-book-authors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... Porcupine (1992)\\n* England, England (1998) – shortlisted for the Booker Prize\\n* Love, etc (2000) – sequel to Talking it Over\\n* Arthur & George (2005) – shortlisted for the Man Booker Prize\\n* The Sense of an Ending (2011) – winner of the Man Booker Prize\\n* The Noise of Time (2016)\\n* The Only Story (2018 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julian_Barnes\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"609199976f7a909e01db7deaa5a34014fd7642e38eda3844a92d08201ecd31db\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"a9a1a912695efb30675a9ec83e464da8abec22f7168c4de67d0ae161bf6bd38a\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Booker International Prize created 2005 translated 25 languages\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_510ca1a803ef4194b5a1878c"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The award was \"originally created in the 2000s.\" The Man Asian Literary Prize (2007) fits well. Let me look at its winners and shortlist in the 2010s.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize winners list 2010 2011 2012 2013\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize shortlist nominees 2010s\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_1f78cd67967842ffa0559246","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\"